  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal for ESMAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the appraisal is a final quality assurance check in accordance to the Danida Aid Management Guidelines, including review of the underlying documentation, the design and justification of the proposed new phase grant and interview with relevant stakeholders. Particularly, the appraisal to assess the risk and opportunities for the new Business Plan, ambitious budget and new Trust Fund 2.0 structure within  the World Bank. Further, how synergies and links can be strengthened to other Danish engagement within the Danish SDG7 Leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
